# Scacelith - Български (Bulgarian)
#
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same order, same {n}). Plurals: one|other (only 1 is
# "one"); a masculine noun that is not a person takes its count form after a number ("1 ход|3 хода").
# Register: polite plural "вие", lowercase in running text (вие, ви, ваш); buttons and menu commands
# in the 2nd person singular imperative or a noun ("Запази", "Предай се", "Настройки"), as in Windows.
# The player's gender is unknown: no form agrees with it (aorist, present, nouns, or the plural
# participles of the polite "вие"). Terms follow glossary/bg.md (дама, топ, офицер, кон, цар; реми).
# Titles in Cyrillic capitals: the title face is an inscriptional capital face.

